 ("Is Banggood available in Pakistan?", "You can open Banggood from Pakistan and select Pakistan as the ship-to country, but in November 2026 its shipping pages showed no method or delivery time for Pakistan."),
 ("Does Banggood offer cash on delivery in Pakistan?", "No. Banggood's payment page listed cash on delivery only for some Gulf and Southeast Asian countries and India."),
 ("How long does Banggood take to deliver?", "Banggood counts delivery as processing plus shipping time in business days. We could not see an estimate for Pakistan on its pages."),
 ("Will I pay customs on a Banggood order?", "Yes, if the parcel is worth more than Rs 1,000. Customs then charges duty and taxes on the whole value."),
 ("Can I import a drone from Banggood to Pakistan?", "Drones need prior permission in Pakistan. Check the current rules before you order one from any site."),
